                "text": "As an emergency room doctor, I\u2019ve seen firsthand how Emergency Medical Treatment & Labor Act (EMTALA) saves lives. When a woman\u2019s life is at risk during pregnancy, she has the right to emergency care, no matter what state she\u2019s in.\n\u00a0\nThis isn\u2019t politics. It\u2019s lifesaving care, and it\u2019s the law of the land. Listen to one story here.",
